s is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests, and 12% gross margins are typical of commodity economics where competitors can replicate the product cheaply.","The company is burning through $86M of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","On the balance sheet, thin -3500.2\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and stock-based comp at 533% of revenue is silent dilution an owner has to account for, and insiders hold 34% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 2/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Very elevated short interest (15.5% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting against the business","sev":"red","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Operating margins 3631% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"ROIC sits in the bottom quartile among Basic Materials peers \u2014 no moat advantage to speak of","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Basic Materials peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Weakness in commodity prices pressures materials companies","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Commodity price volatility and cost-curve position \u2014 in a downturn only the lowest-cost producer has a business, and the rest carry the overhead.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Environmental remediation liability \u2014 tightening regulations on emissions, tailings, and water use create open-ended balance-sheet risk that grows with each legislative cycle.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Trade policy and tariff whiplash \u2014 materials producers are first-order casualties of protectionist swings, and margin gets squeezed from both input and output pricing.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Valued at a 182% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"USA Rare Earth (NASDAQ:USAR) Stock Rating Lowered by Zacks Research","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/13/usa-rare-earth-nasdaqusar-stock-rating-lowered-by-zacks-research.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794574272.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.612,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"What Does USA Rare Earth (USAR) First Magnet Sale Mean For Revenue Timing?","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/materials/nasdaq-usar/usa-rare-earth/news/what-does-usa-rare-earth-usar-first-magnet-sale-mean-for-rev","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794536920.237,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.178,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"USA Rare Earth (NASDAQ:USAR) Reports Q3 2026 Results with 375M Shares Outstanding","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/news/announcements/usa-rare-earth-nasdaqusar-reports-q3-2026-results-with-375m-shares-outstanding","date":"2026-11-12","timestamp":1794520945.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.735,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Critical Metals Rises 3% as Rare Earth Stocks Extend Rally; USA Rare Earth Climbs 3%, MP Materials Gains 2%","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com/articles/critical-metals-rises-3-rare-141807000.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794579912.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.421,"tier":1,"scope